00:55:26.160 --> 00:55:30.570
<v Ira Glass>Alex, you know you have come this far.

00:55:30.570 --> 00:55:31.470
<v Alex Blumberg>Don't say it.

00:55:31.470 --> 00:55:33.460
<v Ira Glass>Do the credits.

