00:56:16.010 --> 00:56:28.490
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>That's so crazy. It just sounds so crazy now. I mean I understand at the time that might have made sense, but it sounds crazy now.

00:56:28.490 --> 00:56:33.120
<v Pascal Lamy>That's the definition. You just gave a very good definition of a mistake.

00:56:33.120 --> 00:56:37.890
<v Alex Blumberg>Which is weird because when I asked him what it was like hearing me take over the show this is what he said to my face.

00:56:37.890 --> 00:56:40.820
<v Katarina Margaritu>It was like the Manna from heaven.

00:56:40.820 --> 00:57:32.290
<v Alex Blumberg>I'm Alex Blumberg. Come back next week for more stories of This American Life .

